<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="jadden picardal" description="jadden picardal" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<main class="homepage-container">
			<div class="content">
				<p>Hi, I'm Jadden Picardal. <span class="email">jadden [at] jam [dot] ms</span></p>
				
				<p>I'm a programmer and designer, currently finishing up my BSCompeE at <a href="https://www.purdue.edu/" target="_blank">Purdue</a> (Fall 2026)</p>

				<p>Currently creating experimental work for startups at <a href="https://lowercase.club/" target="_blank">lowercase</a> & XR simulations at the <a href="https://envision.center" target="_blank">Envision Center</a></p>

				<p>I also make <a href="https://jam.ms" target="_blank">games</a> with friends and edit <a href="https://tiktok.com/@okigarakii" target="_blank">videos</a></p>

				<p>Links... <a href="https://github.com/jaddenki" target="_blank">GitHub</a>, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jadden-picardal" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>, <a href="https://www.are.na/jadden-picardal/jadden-picardal-4h2pfujye8i" target="_blank">Are.na</a>, <a href="https://x.com/igarakii" target="_blank">Twitter</a><br />Just wanna chat? <a href="https://cal.com/jadden" target="_blank">Let's find a time</a></p>
				<p>Populating this page... Stay tuned</p>
			</div>

			<section class="projects-gallery">
				<div class="gallery-grid">
					{projects.map((project) => {
						const isWide = project.aspectRatio === '19/6' || project.aspectRatio === '16/9';
						const isSquare = project.aspectRatio === '1/1';
						const gridSpan = isWide ? 'grid-column: span 2;' : '';
						const squareClass = isSquare ? 'gallery-item-square' : '';
						return project.hasPage ? (
							<a href={project.hasPage} class={squareClass} style={`--aspect-ratio: ${project.aspectRatio}; ${gridSpan}`}>
								<img
									src={project.image}
									alt={project.title}
									loading="lazy"
									class="gallery-image"
								/>
							</a>
						) : (
							<div class={squareClass} style={gridSpan}>
								<img
									src={project.image}
									alt={project.title}
									loading="lazy"
									class="gallery-image"
									style={`aspect-ratio: ${project.aspectRatio};`}
								/>
							</div>
						);
					})}
				</div>
			</section>
		</main>
		<footer>
			<nav class="webring-nav">
				<a href="https://ring.purduehackers.com/previous?host=https://jaddens.page" class="webring-link" title="Previous site">
					&lt;
				</a>
				<a href="https://ring.purduehackers.com/" class="webring-link webring-logo" title="Purdue Hackers Webring">
					Purdue Hackers
				</a>
				<a href="https://ring.purduehackers.com/next?host=https://jaddens.page" class="webring-link" title="Next site">
					&gt;
				</a>
			</nav>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
